{"seq":4,"slug":"immutability-vs-mutability","title":"不可变 vs 可变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/state-management-patterns/fundamentals/immutability-vs-mutability","wordCount":653,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"不可变-vs-可变\">不可变 vs 可变</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>不可变 (Immutability) 和可变 (Mutability) 是两种修改数据的方式，对状态管理影响巨大。不可变数据在每次修改时创建新对象，保留了变更历史，使得时间旅行调试、浅比较优化和并发安全成为可能。可变数据直接修改原对象，代码更简洁但牺牲了可追踪性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据修改] --&gt; B{策略选择}&#10;    B --&gt; C[不可变]&#10;    B --&gt; D[可变]&#10;    C --&gt; E[创建新对象]&#10;    C --&gt; F[保留历史]&#10;    C --&gt; G[浅比较优化]&#10;    D --&gt; H[直接修改]&#10;    D --&gt; I[代码简洁]&#10;    D --&gt; J[需要 Proxy 追踪]\">graph TD\n    A[数据修改] --&gt; B{策略选择}\n    B --&gt; C[不可变]\n    B --&gt; D[可变]\n    C --&gt; E[创建新对象]\n    C --&gt; F[保留历史]\n    C --&gt; G[浅比较优化]\n    D --&gt; H[直接修改]\n    D --&gt; I[代码简洁]\n    D --&gt; J[需要 Proxy 追踪]</pre><h2 id=\"定义\">定义</h2><h3 id=\"可变-mutable\">可变 (Mutable)</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>: 直接修改原对象。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 可变：直接修改&#10;const user = { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 30 };&#10;user.age = 31; // 修改了原对象！&#10;console.log(user); // { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 31 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可变：直接修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修改了原对象！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// { name: 'Alice', age: 31 }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"不可变-immutable\">不可变 (Immutable)</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>: 不修改原对象，创建新对象。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 不可变：创建新对象&#10;const user = { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 30 };&#10;const updatedUser = { ...user, age: 31 }; // 新对象！&#10;console.log(user); // 原对象没变：{ name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 30 }&#10;console.log(updatedUser); // 新对象：{ name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 31 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可变：创建新对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> updatedUser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新对象！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原对象没变：{ name: 'Alice', age: 30 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(updatedUser); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新对象：{ name: 'Alice', age: 31 }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"对比\">对比</h2><h3 id=\"代码对比\">代码对比</h3><h4 id=\"可变方式\">可变方式</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 修改数组&#10;const todos = [{ text: &#39;Learn React&#39;, done: false }];&#10;todos[0].done = true; // 直接修改&#10;todos.push({ text: &#39;Learn Redux&#39;, done: false }); // 直接修改&#10;&#10;// 修改对象&#10;const state = { count: 0 };&#10;state.count++; // 直接修改\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修改数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> todos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [{ text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Learn React'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">todos[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 直接修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">todos.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Learn Redux'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 直接修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修改对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 直接修改</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"不可变方式\">不可变方式</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 修改数组&#10;const todos = [{ text: &#39;Learn React&#39;, done: false }];&#10;const updatedTodos = [&#10;  { ...todos[0], done: true }, // 更新第一项&#10;  { text: &#39;Learn Redux&#39;, done: false }, // 添加新项&#10;];&#10;&#10;// 修改对象&#10;const state = { count: 0 };&#10;const newState = { ...state, count: state.count + 1 };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修改数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> todos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [{ text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Learn React'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> updatedTodos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">todos[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 更新第一项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Learn Redux'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 添加新项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修改对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state, count: state.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优缺点对比\">优缺点对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>可变 (Mutable)</th>\n<th>不可变 (Immutable)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存使用</td>\n<td>少（复用对象）</td>\n<td>多（创建新对象）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可预测性</td>\n<td>差（可能被意外修改）</td>\n<td>好（不会被意外修改）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可调试性</td>\n<td>难（变化追踪困难）</td>\n<td>易（可以时间旅行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>快（直接修改）</td>\n<td>需要优化（结构共享）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 渲染</td>\n<td>需要深层比较</td>\n<td>引用比较即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"不可变的好处\">不可变的好处</h2><h3 id=\"1-可预测性\">1. 可预测性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 不可变：函数不会修改输入&#10;function updateUser(user: User) {&#10;  return { ...user, lastLogin: Date.now() };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const user = { name: &#39;Alice&#39; };&#10;const updated = updateUser(user);&#10;console.log(user); // 没变！不用担心副作用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可变：函数不会修改输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user, lastLogin: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> updated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 没变！不用担心副作用</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-时间旅行调试\">2. 时间旅行调试</h3><p>Redux DevTools 可以让你回到任何之前的状态，因为状态是不可变的，每一步都保存了完整的快照。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-react-性能优化\">3. React 性能优化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// React.memo 可以用引用比较&#10;const TodoItem = React.memo(({ todo }) =&gt; {&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{todo.text}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 只有 todo 的引用变了，才重新渲染&#10;// 不可变让这变得简单\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React.memo 可以用引用比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TodoItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> React.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">memo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">todo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{todo.text}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只有 todo 的引用变了，才重新渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可变让这变得简单</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"4-变更追踪简单\">4. 变更追踪简单</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 只需要比较引用&#10;if (prevState !== nextState) {&#10;  // 状态变了，更新 UI&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只需要比较引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prevState </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 状态变了，更新 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"不可变的实现方式\">不可变的实现方式</h2><h3 id=\"1-手动实现-对象展开\">1. 手动实现（对象展开）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 对象&#10;const state = { count: 0, user: { name: &#39;Alice&#39; } };&#10;const newState = {&#10;  ...state,&#10;  count: state.count + 1,&#10;  user: { ...state.user, name: &#39;Bob&#39; }, // 嵌套更新&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 数组&#10;const todos = [{ id: 1, text: &#39;Learn&#39; }];&#10;const newTodos = [...todos.map((t) =&gt; (t.id === 1 ? { ...t, done: true } : t)), { id: 2, text: &#39;New todo&#39; }];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span cla